        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "team_0150_botan_02",
      "hash64": "D934DB368E4D8625",
      "text": "Bueno, pues ya es oficial...\\nEl Team Star y yo no volveremos a...[VAR 0x0114(0008)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 65,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0008"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "team_0150_nelke_02",
      "hash64": "8E99792DDE19EC9A",
      "text": "No te precip... ¡Para el carro, tronca!\\nHay algo que me gustaría aclarar antes.[VAR 0x0114(001E)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 79,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001E"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "team_0150_botan_03",
      "hash64": "D934DA368E4D8472",
      "text": "¿El qué?[VAR 0x0114(0008)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 8,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0008"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "team_0150_nelke_03",
      "hash64": "8E997A2DDE19EE4D",
      "text": "Eres la autoridad suprema de la pandilla, ¿no?\\c\\n¿Por qué montaste la Operación Stardust en vez\\nde disolver el Team Star tú misma?[VAR 0x0114(001E)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 46,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 131,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001E"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "team_0150_botan_04",
      "hash64": "D934D5368E4D7BF3",
      "text": "Lo intenté. Créeme que lo intenté, pero los\\ndemás se negaron...[VAR 0x0114(0008)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 63,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0008"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "team_0150_nelke_04",
      "hash64": "8E99732DDE19E268",
      "text": "¿No están obligados a cumplir tus órdenes?[VAR 0x0114(001E)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 42,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001E"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "team_0150_botan_05",
      "hash64": "D934D4368E4D7A40",
      "text": "Puedo pedirles que hagan cosas, pero no soy\\nquién para obligarlos a hacer algo a la fuerza.\\r\\nAsí lo dice nuestro código.[VAR 0x0114(0008)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 91,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 122,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0008"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "team_0150_nelke_05",
      "hash64": "8E99742DDE19E41B",
      "text": "El código, ¿eh? Imagino que los jefes también\\nlo seguirían a rajatabla.[VAR 0x0114(001E)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 71,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001E"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "team_0150_botan_06",
      "hash64": "D934D7368E4D7F59",
      "text": "Por eso se me ocurrió usarlo en su contra para\\nprovocar su disolución.[VAR 0x0114(0008)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 70,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0008"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "team_0150_nelke_06",
      "hash64": "8E99752DDE19E5CE",
      "text": "¿Porque todos abandonarían el Team Star si se\\nbasa en un motivo estipulado por el código?[VAR 0x0114(001E)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 89,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001E"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "team_0150_botan_07",
      "hash64": "D934D6368E4D7DA6",
      "text": "Exacto... Según las reglas, tenían que combatir\\nsí o sí.[VAR 0x0114(0008)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 56,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0008"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "team_0150_nelke_07",
      "hash64": "8E99762DDE19E781",
      "text": "Y así es como nació la Operación Stardust...[VAR 0x0114(001E)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 44,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001E"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "team_0150_nelke_08",
      "hash64": "8E996F2DDE19DB9C",
      "text": "Una última pregunta, Casiopea.[VAR 0x0114(001E)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 30,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001E"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "team_0150_nelke_09",
      "hash64": "8E99702DDE19DD4F",
      "text": "¿Qué es para ti el Team...? No, mejor dicho...\\n¿Qué significan para ti tus compis de la pandilla?[VAR 0x0114(001E)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 97,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001E"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "label": "team_0150_botan_08",
      "hash64": "D934E1368E4D9057",
      "text": "Ellos...\\c\\nSon...[VAR 0x0114(0008)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 8,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 18,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0008"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "label": "team_0150_botan_09",
      "hash64": "D934E0368E4D8EA4",
      "text": "Mi tesoro más preciado.[VAR 0x0114(0008)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 23,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0008"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "label": "team_0150_nelke_10",
      "hash64": "8E9C7D2DDE1C293D",
      "text": "Una respuesta muy loable, mi estimada y bien\\nponderada Noa.[VAR 0x0114(001E)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 59,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001E"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 19,
      "label": "team_0150_botan_10",
      "hash64": "D931D3368E4B42B6",
      "text": "¿Eh?[VAR 0x0114(0008)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 4,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0008"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 20,
      "label": "team_0150_nelke_11",
      "hash64": "8E9C7C2DDE1C278A",
      "text": "Y, si me permites, me gustaría abordar contigo\\ncierta cuestión.[VAR 0x0114(001E)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 63,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001E"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 21,
      "label": "team_0150_botan_11",
      "hash64": "D931D4368E4B4469",
      "text": "¿A qué viene esa forma de hablar tan pomposa?\\nMe estás dando un mal rollo...[VAR 0x0114(0008)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 76,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0008"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 22,
      "label": "team_0150_nelke_12",
      "hash64": "8E9C7B2DDE1C25D7",
      "text": "Y no te culpo por ello. Antes de proseguir,\\npermíteme revelar mi verdadera identidad.[VAR 0x0114(001E)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 85,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001E"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 23,
      "label": "team_0150_nelke_13",
      "hash64": "8E9C7A2DDE1C2424",
      "text": "¡Tachán![VAR 0x0114(001E)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 8,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001E"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 24,
      "label": "team_0150_botan_12",
      "hash64": "D931D1368E4B3F50",
      "text": "Se... ¡¿Señor director?![VAR 0x0114(0008)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 24,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0008"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 25,
      "label": "team_0150_nelke_14",
      "hash64": "8E9C792DDE1C2271",
      "text": "Si Casiopea era tu alter ego, podría decirse que\\nCael era el mío.[VAR 0x0114(000A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 65,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "000A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 26,
      "label": "team_0150_botan_13",
      "hash64": "D931D2368E4B4103",
      "text": "Pero... ¡¿por qué?![VAR 0x0114(0008)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 19,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0008"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 27,
      "label": "team_0150_nelke_15",
      "hash64": "8E9C782DDE1C20BE",
      "text": "[EMPTY 32]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 0,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "BDFF",
          "args_hex": [
            "0020"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 28,
      "label": "team_0150_nelke_16",
      "hash64": "8E9C772DDE1C1F0B",
      "text": "Me pareció el método más idóneo para hablar\\nde tú a tú con los miembros del Team Star.[VAR 0x0114(000A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 86,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "000A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 29,
      "label": "team_0150_nelke_17",
      "hash64": "8E9C762DDE1C1D58",
      "text": "Sincerarse con los profesores no es una tarea\\nsencilla a vuestra edad.\\c\\nSupuse que los alumnos os sentiríais incluso más\\ncohibidos si fuera yo, el director de la academia,\\r\\nquien intentara hablar con vosotros.[VAR 0x0114(000A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 70,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 173,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 213,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "000A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 30,
      "label": "team_0150_botan_14",
      "hash64": "D931D7368E4B4982",
      "text": "Sí, sí, suena muy bonito y todo eso, pero...\\c\\n¡¿De verdad era necesario llevar esas pintas?!\\nPor no hablar de esa peluca tan... tan... así.[VAR 0x0114(0008)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 44,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 141,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0008"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 31,
      "label": "team_0150_nelke_18",
      "hash64": "8E9C752DDE1C1BA5",
      "text": "Ejem...\\c\\nBueno, pasemos a lo que de verdad importa.\\n¡Ya podéis salir, chicos![VAR 0x0114(000A)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
